      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HE'S A MONTY (1) was below best at his last start when 6th at this track following a win (20.54) there two back. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Tough to beat if on-song. BROOKLYN (8) jumped cleanly from the low draw gave a big sight to finish third and beaten 2.5 lengths (20.47) at this track in a TG1-4W over 342m. Bold showing expected. AXEL BREAKER (2) had been going along well winning a Maiden three back then placing at this track before missing the frame latest when sixth (20.89) at this track. Has good early burn and drawn to be prominent early off a low draw. Expected to do much better this time. PANTS (5) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
